# request-coverage reads three files outside its own directory: the validator under test, the sibling
# grammar it shells to (validate-locked-anchor.sh), and harness-origin.json, which the validator and
# the BL-327 arm read. The map rows under .git/.claude/core/skills are walk-up probes, not reads.
!core/scripts/validate-request-coverage.sh
core/scripts/validate-locked-anchor.sh
core/schemas/harness-origin.json
